concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-295n a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "295N Criteria for deciding authorisation applications"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-295n ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, specify criteria for deciding authorisation applications made under the integrated public number database scheme.  (2) The Minister may specify different criteria for different kinds of authorisation applications.  (3) In deciding an authorisation application, the ACMA:  (a) must apply the criteria applicable to that application; and  (b) may have regard to any other matters that it thinks are relevant." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, specify criteria for deciding authorisation applications made under the integrated public number database scheme.  (2) The Minister may specify different criteria for different kinds of authorisation applications.  (3) In deciding an authorisation application, the ACMA:  (a) must apply the criteria applicable to that application; and  (b) may have regard to any other matters that it thinks are relevant."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fd3fe94ca4337bb1fbb4c0d0192f7b8f1031be79191519f47355bf08ddd2278a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2006-sch-1-sec-295n-ss-1 ;
